gent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:07.660" end="00:07.872">По</span><span begin="00:07.872" end="00:08.258">пробуй </span><span begin="00:08.258" end="00:08.498">тронь </span><span begin="00:08.498" end="00:08.903">меня, </span><span begin="00:08.903" end="00:09.310">бы</span><span begin="00:09.310" end="00:09.497">дло</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Try to touch me, you cattle</span></p><p begin="00:09.553" end="00:10.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:09.553" end="00:09.769">О</span><span begin="00:09.769" end="00:09.932">кей, </span><span begin="00:09.932" end="00:10.314">Незер </span><span begin="00:10.314" end="00:10.474">во </span><span begin="00:10.474" end="00:10.969">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Okay, the Nether's in me</span></p><p begin="00:10.995" end="00:13.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:10.995" end="00:11.095">Я </span><span begin="00:11.095" end="00:11.428">столь</span><span begin="00:11.428" end="00:11.520">ко </span><span begin="00:11.520" end="00:11.978">лавы </span><span begin="00:11.978" end="00:12.210">не </span><span begin="00:12.210" end="00:12.670">ви</span><span begin="00:12.670" end="00:13.091">дывал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I've never seen so much lava</span></p><p begin="00:13.091" end="00:14.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:13.091" end="00:13.206">И </span><span begin="00:13.206" end="00:13.697">незер </span><span begin="00:13.697" end="00:13.875">на </span><span begin="00:13.875" end="00:14.356">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">And nether's on me</span></p><p begin="00:14.356" end="00:16.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:14.356" end="00:14.538">По</span><span begin="00:14.538" end="00:14.941">пробуй </span><span begin="00:14.941" end="00:15.107">тронь </span><span begin="00:15.107" end="00:15.544">меня, </span><span begin="00:15.544" end="00:15.974">бы</span><span begin="00:15.974" end="00:16.200">дло</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Try to touch me, you cattle</span></p><p begin="00:16.200" end="00:17.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:16.200" end="00:16.426">О</span><span begin="00:16.426" end="00:16.534">кей, </span><span begin="00:16.534" end="00:16.997">Незер </span><span begin="00:16.997" end="00:17.233">во </span><span begin="00:17.233" end="00:17.674">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Okay, the Nether's in me</span></p><p begin="00:17.674" end="00:19.989" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:17.674" end="00:17.763">Я </span><span begin="00:17.763" end="00:18.108">столь</span><span begin="00:18.108" end="00:18.224">ко </span><span begin="00:18.224" end="00:18.630">лавы </span><span begin="00:18.630" end="00:18.829">не </span><span begin="00:18.829" end="00:19.332">ви</span><span begin="00:19.332" end="00:19.989">дывал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I've never seen so much lava</span></p><p begin="00:20.374" end="00:23.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:20.374" end="00:20.664">Иду </span><span begin="00:20.664" end="00:20.773">в </span><span begin="00:20.773" end="00:21.209">незе</span><span begin="00:21.209" end="00:21.554">рите, </span><span begin="00:21.554" end="00:21.929">Yellow </span><span begin="00:21.929" end="00:22.416">Fire </span><span begin="00:22.416" end="00:22.579">на </span><span begin="00:22.579" end="00:22.902">ре</span><span begin="00:22.902" end="00:23.321">пите</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I'm going in netherite, Yellow Fire's on repeat</span></p><p begin="00:23.717" end="00:26.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:23.717" end="00:24.056">Прошлый </span><span begin="00:24.056" end="00:24.363">час </span><span begin="00:24.363" end="00:24.512">я </span><span begin="00:24.512" end="00:24.942">видел </span><span begin="00:24.942" end="00:25.073">не</span><span begin="00:25.073" end="00:25.290">зе</span><span begin="00:25.290" end="00:25.595">рит </span><span begin="00:25.595" end="00:25.665">и </span><span begin="00:25.665" end="00:26.125">лаву — </span><span begin="00:26.125" end="00:26.643">читер!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Last hour I saw netherite and lava — cheater!</span></p><p begin="00:27.058" end="00:29.986" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:27.058" end="00:27.377">Иду </span><span begin="00:27.377" end="00:27.445">в </span><span begin="00:27.445" end="00:27.888">незе</span><span begin="00:27.888" end="00:28.260">рите, </span><span begin="00:28.260" end="00:28.601">Yellow </span><span begin="00:28.601" end="00:29.141">Fire </span><span begin="00:29.141" end="00:29.357">на </span><span begin="00:29.357" end="00:29.573">ре</span><span begin="00:29.573" end="00:29.986">пите</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I'm going in netherite, Yellow Fire's on repeat</span></p><p begin="00:30.338" end="00:32.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:30.338" end="00:30.698">Прошлый </span><span begin="00:30.698" end="00:31.012">час </span><span begin="00:31.012" end="00:31.168">я </span><span begin="00:31.168" end="00:31.533">видел </span><span begin="00:31.533" end="00:31.742">не</span><span begin="00:31.742" end="00:32.001">зе</span><span begin="00:32.001" end="00:32.266">рит </span><span begin="00:32.266" end="00:32.338">и </span><span begin="00:32.338" end="00:32.628">ла</span><span begin="00:32.628" end="00:32.819">ву</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Last hour I saw netherite and lava</span></p><p begin="00:32.819" end="00:36.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:32.819" end="00:33.103">Где-</span><span begin="00:33.103" end="00:33.308">то </span><span begin="00:33.308" end="00:33.514">там </span><span begin="00:33.514" end="00:33.599">я </span><span begin="00:33.599" end="00:33.809">слы</span><span begin="00:33.809" end="00:34.083">шал </span><span begin="00:34.083" end="00:34.303">ба</span><span begin="00:34.303" end="00:34.522">ны — </span><span begin="00:34.522" end="00:34.661">не</span><span begin="00:34.661" end="00:34.935">зе</span><span begin="00:34.935" end="00:35.161">рит </span><span begin="00:35.161" end="00:35.379">ко</span><span begin="00:35.379" end="00:35.650">пали </span><span begin="00:35.650" end="00:35.963">стра</span><span begin="00:35.963" end="00:36.197">нно</span> <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Somewhere out there I heard bans — they weirdly dug netherite</span></p><p begin="00:36.200" end="00:39.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.438">Каж</span><span begin="00:36.438" end="00:36.614">дый </span><span begin="00:36.614" end="00:36.854">час </span><span begin="00:36.854" end="00:36.940">ви</span><span begin="00:36.940" end="00:37.264">жу </span><span begin="00:37.264" end="00:37.422">о</span><span begin="00:37.422" end="00:37.641">бла</span><span begin="00:37.641" end="00:37.880">вы — </span><span begin="00:37.880" end="00:38.113">каж</span><span begin="00:38.113" end="00:38.202">дый </span><span begin="00:38.202" end="00:38.487">хо</span><span begin="00:38.487" end="00:38.680">чет </span><span begin="00:38.680" end="00:38.935">быть </span><span begin="00:38.935" end="00:39.140">top </span><span begin="00:39.140" end="00:39.303">o</span><span begin="00:39.303" end="00:39.552">ne-ом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Every hour I see raids — everybody wants to be top one</span></p><p begin="00:39.552" end="00:42.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:39.552" end="00:39.767">Каж</span><span begin="00:39.767" end="00:39.982">дый </span><span begin="00:39.982" end="00:40.214">топ — </span><span begin="00:40.214" end="00:40.446">это </span><span begin="00:40.446" end="00:41.092">выдумка, </span><span begin="00:41.092" end="00:41.405">ведь </span><span begin="00:41.405" end="00:41.586">там </span><span begin="00:41.586" end="00:42.001">нету </span><span begin="00:42.001" end="00:42.692">меня </span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Every top is a fiction, because I'm not there</span></p><p begin="00:42.893" end="00:45.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="00:42.893" end="00:43.074">И</span><span begin="00:43.074" end="00:43.281">ду </span><span begin="00:43.281" end="00:43.802">трейдиться </span><span begin="00:43.802" end="00:43.942">с </span><span begin="00:43.942" end="00:44.469">пиглином, </span><span begin="00:44.469" end="00:44.638">на </span><span begin="00:44.638" end="00:44.864">мне </span><span begin="00:44.864" end="00:45.366">незер </span><span begin="00:45.366" end="00:45.920">броня</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.581"><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.182">(Ха-</span><span begin="00:46.182" end="00:46.581">ха!)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Haha!</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I go trade with a piglin, Nether armor's on me</span></p><p begin="00:46.581" end="00:47.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="00:46.581" end="00:46.975">Незер </span><span begin="00:46.975" end="00:47.146">на </span><span begin="00:47.146" end="00:47.482">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Nether's on me</span></p><p begin="00:47.664" end="00:49.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="00:47.664" end="00:47.857">По</span><span begin="00:47.857" end="00:48.258">пробуй </span><span begin="00:48.258" end="00:48.457">тронь </span><span begin="00:48.457" end="00:48.889">меня, </span><span begin="00:48.889" end="00:49.321">бы</span><span begin="00:49.321" end="00:49.562">дло</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Try to touch me, you cattle</span></p><p begin="00:49.562" end="00:50.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="00:49.562" end="00:49.773">О</span><span begin="00:49.773" end="00:49.923">кей, </span><span begin="00:49.923" end="00:50.253">Незер </span><span begin="00:50.253" end="00:50.555">во </span><span begin="00:50.555" end="00:50.812">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Okay, the Nether's in me</span></p><p begin="00:51.008" end="00:53.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="00:51.008" end="00:51.100">Я </span><span begin="00:51.100" end="00:51.393">столь</span><span begin="00:51.393" end="00:51.510">ко </span><span begin="00:51.510" end="00:51.934">лавы </span><span begin="00:51.934" end="00:52.132">не </span><span begin="00:52.132" end="00:52.676">ви</span><span begin="00:52.676" end="00:53.093">дывал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I've never seen so much lava</span></p><p begin="00:53.093" end="00:54.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="00:53.093" end="00:53.202">И </span><span begin="00:53.202" end="00:53.686">незер </span><span begin="00:53.686" end="00:53.865">на </span><span begin="00:53.865" end="00:54.158">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">And nether's on me</span></p><p begin="00:54.349" end="00:56.221" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="00:54.349" end="00:54.538">По</span><span begin="00:54.538" end="00:54.940">пробуй </span><span begin="00:54.940" end="00:55.158">тронь </span><span begin="00:55.158" end="00:55.552">меня, </span><span begin="00:55.552" end="00:55.981">бы</span><span begin="00:55.981" end="00:56.221">дло</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Try to touch me, you cattle</span></p><p begin="00:56.221" end="00:57.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="00:56.221" end="00:56.429">О</span><span begin="00:56.429" end="00:56.553">кей, </span><span begin="00:56.553" end="00:57.009">Незер </span><span begin="00:57.009" end="00:57.206">во </span><span begin="00:57.206" end="00:57.485">мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Okay, the Nether's in me</span></p><p begin="00:57.691" end="00:59.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="00:57.691" end="00:57.779">Я </span><span begin="00:57.779" end="00:58.118">столь</span><span begin="00:58.118" end="00:58.206">ко </span><span begin="00:58.206" end="00:58.612">лавы </span><span begin="00:58.612" end="00:58.820">не </span><span begin="00:58.820" end="00:59.356">ви</span><span begin="00:59.356" end="00:59.787">дывал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I've never seen so much lava</span></p><p begin="00:59.787" end="01:01.135" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="00:59.787" end="00:59.880">Ты </span><span begin="00:59.880" end="01:00.408">слышишь </span><span begin="01:00.408" end="01:00.666">этот </span><span begin="01:00.666" end="01:01.135">звук?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Do you hear this sound?</span></p><p begin="01:01.135" end="01:02.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:01.135" end="01:01.587">Ха, </span><span begin="01:01.587" end="01:02.044">нико</span><span begin="01:02.044" end="01:02.274">го </span><span begin="01:02.274" end="01:02.464">во</span><span begin="01:02.464" end="01:02.801">круг</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Hah, nobody around</span></p><p begin="01:02.875" end="01:06.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:02.875" end="01:03.103">Я </span><span begin="01:03.103" end="01:03.304">как </span><span begin="01:03.304" end="01:03.637">пиглин — </span><span begin="01:03.637" end="01:03.996">нужно </span><span begin="01:03.996" end="01:04.564">золо</span><span begin="01:04.564" end="01:04.794">то, </span><span begin="01:04.971" end="01:05.151">у </span><span begin="01:05.151" end="01:05.576">меня </span><span begin="01:05.576" end="01:06.053">недуг</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I'm like a piglin — I need gold, I have an affliction</span></p><p begin="01:06.148" end="01:09.154" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:06.148" end="01:06.384">Я </span><span begin="01:06.384" end="01:06.804">хочу </span><span begin="01:06.804" end="01:06.953">быть </span><span begin="01:06.953" end="01:07.060">в </span><span begin="01:07.060" end="01:07.450">незе</span><span begin="01:07.450" end="01:07.822">рите, </span><span begin="01:07.822" end="01:08.302">прямо </span><span begin="01:08.302" end="01:08.591">как </span><span begin="01:08.591" end="01:08.667">и </span><span begin="01:08.667" end="01:08.869">мой </span><span begin="01:08.869" end="01:09.154">друг</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I want to be in netherite, just like my friend</span></p><p begin="01:09.552" end="01:12.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:09.552" end="01:09.719">Я </span><span begin="01:09.719" end="01:10.131">хочу </span><span begin="01:10.131" end="01:10.296">быть </span><span begin="01:10.296" end="01:10.370">в </span><span begin="01:10.370" end="01:10.786">незе</span><span begin="01:10.786" end="01:11.171">рите, </span><span begin="01:11.171" end="01:11.357">я </span><span begin="01:11.357" end="01:11.952">лутаю </span><span begin="01:11.952" end="01:12.522">сундук</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I want to be in netherite — I'm looting a chest</span></p><p begin="01:12.866" end="01:15.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:12.866" end="01:13.283">Вижу </span><span begin="01:13.283" end="01:13.951">басти</span><span begin="01:13.951" end="01:14.313">он — </span><span begin="01:14.313" end="01:14.789">беру </span><span begin="01:14.789" end="01:15.387">страй</span><span begin="01:15.387" end="01:15.874">дера</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">I see a bastion — I take a strider</span></p><p begin="01:16.245" end="01:19.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:16.245" end="01:16.620">Вижу </span><span begin="01:16.620" end="01:17.063">гас</span><span begin="01:17.063" end="01:17.277">та, </span><span begin=